	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/><persName ref="p2899">Matthias Schenckius</persName> d. <persName ref="p495">Hainrico Bul<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>lingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>S. D.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Non necesse esse puto, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> doctissime, me multis verbis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>causas commemorare, quibus adductus ad te hoc tempore <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>scribam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Tantum scribo doctorem <persName ref="p2856">Gereonem</persName>, cum diebus superioribus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/><placeName ref="l257">Constantiam</placeName> me conferrem, hoc mihi oneris imposuisse, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>primum ut pecuniam hanc, quae est 13gl.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">54kr., item <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>1 1/2gl.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">ad te quam primum mittam, deinde ut mittendarum <placeName ref="l18">Aug<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ustam</placeName> literarum viam tibi aliquam commonstrem, quando tanta <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>isthinc eo commeantium est paucitas.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Notus ergo tibi, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>mi d. <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, est <persName ref="p4868">Iacobus Funkelius</persName>, ecclesiasta <placeName ref="l49">Bielensis</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quippe qui, ut audio, hoc ipso tempore, quo haec scribo, vobis<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cum est.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Is fratrem hic habet <persName ref="p20487">Ioannem Ulricum Kündigmann</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Dieser verspricht Biel 1563 seine Dienste, um durch Kaiser Bestätigung der Freiheiten zu erhalten (<placeName ref="l49">Biel</placeName> Stadtarchiv 102, CXVII, Nr. 44); entschuldigt 1558 das Ausbleiben einer entsprechenden Bestätigungsurkunde (ebd., Nr. 154). Halbbruder von <persName ref="p4868">Jakob Funcklin</persName>; vgl. dessen Vita von Max Schiendorfer (2006 noch unpubl.).</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nemini nostrum ignotum; cui si reddendas literas tuas deinceps <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>curaris, non est dubium, quin quam primum eas d. Gereon sit <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>accepturus, cum decimo quarto quoque die aliquis <placeName ref="l18">Augustam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>inde eat, taceo alios multos, qui quotidie fere inveniuntur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>D. <persName ref="p1283">Conradum Gessnerum</persName> meis verbis, si sine molestia facere <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>potes, meis verbis salutabis et me cum liberis septenis celeb <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>em precibus tuis adiuvabis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sperabam me in patria <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>tantisper mansurum, dum tu d. <persName ref="p2856">Gereoni</persName> rescriberes; sed <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>video fieri id non posse; etenim et muneris mei ratio <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>(praesum autem scholae <placeName ref="l18">Augustanae</placeName>) et rei domesticae admini<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>stratio domum me vocant, ut commorari hic diutius <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>non possim.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> optime, et me ama.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l257">Constantiae</placeName> 8. calendas martias anno 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Viro optimo atque doctis<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>simo d. <persName ref="p495">Hainrico <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiastae <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, domino <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>suo observando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
